    "catalogue_description": "Lite version of the Train_Dead map. Now you can go to the roof of the car. If you fell off the car, you will appear on the respawn (8th car). The Vogon restaurant has a hint for earning bonus points. The task is the same \u2013 to get to the locomotive and call artillery support. Features: \u2013 zombie counter; \u2013 7 perks; \u2013 buyable game ending (THE END); \u2013 Infinite Warfare weapons; \u2013 no dogs; \u2013 no teleports; \u2013 no boxes with weapons (all weapons on the walls); Credits: MrDunlop4 \u2013 Nuketown 2025 Character; drdan1959 \u2013 Shunting diesel locomotive model; asus89 \u2013 p6_blk_fluorescent_light models; ugx-mods.com \u2013 ugx_weapon_box model; shippuden1592 \u2013 weapon models: Kendall&Hornet, X-Eon, G-Rail, Atlas, zm_mp5; Ricos \u2013 weapon model Dingo; Rorke \u2013 weapons m60; nukem \u2013 easy_teleporter scripts; Mrhankey91, Gogeta \u2013 SlideDoors script; Tom_Bmx \u2013 artillery script; SpyroScope \u2013 Text type Typewriter.",
